e would be now or any of that  kind of thing but you know he's sort of  of his generation so he studied the guys  that he followed as he developed into  the kind of player he is so not just as  a kid in Los Angeles but in the years  since but I don't know that he goes all  the way back to you know he knows Oscar  and his numbers but as he looked at old  tapes I wouldn't  so good stuff Jonathan we appreciate  your time safe travels and thanks for  joining us  always good talking to you that's a  Jonathan Fagan it covers the Rockettes  for the Houston Chronicle for more Dan  Patrick show to the audience channel 239  on Direct TV or download the Dan Patrick  show app  [Music]

